<title>UK: Plysu moulds profit rise in first half.</title>
<headline>Plysu moulds profit rise in first half.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		4.9		    vs 4.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.0		    vs same</p>
<p> Pretax		     3.56		   vs 3.10</p>
<p> Turnover		   67.09		  vs 63.29</p>
<p>NOTE - Plastics manufacturer Plysu Plc said it remains confident that a satisfactory trend of financial performance will continue despite difficulties in some continental European markets.</p>
<p>It said raw material prices have been less volatile this year and recent increases have been within expectations. &quot;There remains, however, an element of uncertainty regarding further increases,&quot; it added in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
